+ * Window-commit coordinator: candidate preparation and the synchronous
+ * measure/publish/correct section for one reading window.
+ *
+ * One instance is created per reading window by
+ * {@link createWindowCommitFactory}. Tokens live in this instance's table, so a
+ * caller cannot fabricate a valid transaction and a copied token fails the
+ * identity check: the table stores the exact prepared object it handed out.
+ */
